['개최장소: 서면1번가 일원(중앙대로691번길, 서면로, 신천대로62번길 일원)', '//RSS URL 복사
        function urlCopyBtn(){


            var URL = 'https://www.busanjin.go.kr/index.busanjin?menuCd=DOM_000001003003007000';
            var IE = (document.all) ? true : false;
            if(IE) {
                window.clipboardData.setData("Text",URL);
                alert ("주소가 복사되었습니다. \'Ctrl+V\'를 눌러 붙여넣기 해주세요.");
            } else {
                temp = prompt("Ctrl+C를 눌러 클립보드로 복사하세요", URL);
            }
        }
        function snsShare(sns){
            if(sns == 'twi'){
                var param = "?url=https://www.busanjin.go.kr/index.busanjin?menuCd=DOM_000001003003007000";
                var text = "&text=" + $("#faceBookTitle").attr("content") + " [ " + $("#faceBookDescription").attr("content") + " ] ";
//                 param = encodeURI(param);
                text = encodeURI(text);
                window.open("https://twitter.com/intent/tweet" + param + text);
            }else if(sns == 'fb'){
                var param = "?u=https://www.busanjin.go.kr/index.busanjin?menuCd=DOM_000001003003007000";
//                 param = encodeURI(param);
                window.open("http://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php" + param);

            }else if(sns == 'nb'){
                var url = 'https://www.busanjin.go.kr/index.busanjin?menuCd=DOM_000001003003007000';
                //var url = 'https://www.naver.com';
//                 url = encodeURI(url);
                var title = $("#faceBookTitle").attr("content") + " [ " + $("#faceBookDescription").attr("content") + " ] ";
                title = encodeURI(title);
                var shareURL = "https://share.naver.com/web/shareView.nhn?url=" + url + "&title=" + title;
                window.open(shareURL);
            }else if(sns =='kakao'){
                var url = 'https://www.busanjin.go.kr/index.busanjin?menuCd=DOM_000001003003007000';
//                 url = encodeURI(url);
                Kakao.Story.share({
                    url: url,
                    text: $("#faceBookTitle").attr("content") + ' [ ' + $("#faceBookDescription").attr("content") + ' ]'
                });
            }else if(sns =='ins'){

            }else if(sns == ''){

            } else if (sns == 'kakaotalk') {
               if(!Kakao.isInitialized()) Kakao.init('aaa97c8dde7072da2db8ad6570de5d6e');
               Kakao.Link.sendScrap( {
                  requestUrl: decodeURI('https://www.busanjin.go.kr/index.busanjin?menuCd=DOM_000001003003007000')
                } );
            }
        }
        jQuery(document).ready(function($) {
            $(".navi-print-share .print-share .share-btn").click(function() {
                if($(this).parent().hasClass("active")){
                    $(this).parent().removeClass('active');
                    $(this).attr("title", "SNS공유 열기");
                }else{
                    $(this).parent().addClass('active');
                    $(this).attr("title", "SNS공유 닫기");
                }
            });
